      "content": "but what if the strength isn't in continuing the fight? i look at my siblings and my cousins and i just see the next generation of people who are going to suffer because of this. i hate that i'm a part of it. sometimes i think the only real way to actually stop the pain and the cycle is to just... stop being a part of the chain. like, if i wasn't here, the pattern couldn't pass through me to anyone else.",
